A container boundary is read at the container's own column

```
- ::: box
   ::: note
   x
   :::
  :::
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">
      <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
        <p>x</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

